117
00:08:17,694 --> 00:08:22,054
A picture helps. Think of the capstone
as a fortnight on call, compressed.

118
00:08:22,094 --> 00:08:27,049
The difference from a drill is the same as
the difference between on-call duty and a

119
00:08:27,089 --> 00:08:30,201
