122
00:08:37,498 --> 00:08:42,412
Where the comparison breaks, the README
says so itself: the sandbox is kinder than

123
00:08:42,452 --> 00:08:46,459
production. You may read every clone
and you administer the server.

124
00:08:46,499 --> 00:08:51,533
In real life you ask a colleague to paste
a reflog, and server-side steps go through

125
00:08:51,573 --> 00:08:56,487
