at the start of stage N.

152
00:10:45,010 --> 00:10:50,243
In the evaluation, a rebuild counts as
what it would have been in production.

153
00:10:50,583 --> 00:10:54,968
Before the output, predict from the
conventions: what will a squash-merged pull

154
00:10:55,008 --> 00:10:58,665
request look like on main, and what
